---
/*
  Her section divider: a thin gold rule, a four-pointed sparkle, a thin rule.
  Purely decorative, so it is hidden from assistive tech and the sparkle uses
  --gold-deco, which stays #D4AF37 in both themes.
*/
---

<div class="divider" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="divider__rule"></span>
  <svg
    class="divider__mark"
    width="15"
    height="15"
    viewBox="0 0 16 16"
    fill="currentColor"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <path d="M8 0 C8.6 4.6 11.4 7.4 16 8 C11.4 8.6 8.6 11.4 8 16 C7.4 11.4 4.6 8.6 0 8 C4.6 7.4 7.4 4.6 8 0 Z" />
  </svg>
  <span class="divider__rule"></span>
</div>

<style>
  .divider {
    padding-inline: 24px;
  }
  .divider__mark {
    color: var(--gold-deco);
    flex: none;
  }
</style>
